            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Undersizing the Unit for the Room</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A purifier rated for a 300 sq ft room will run at maximum, constant strain in a 500 sq ft basement and never fully clear the air. Manufacturer coverage numbers are often calculated at the minimum acceptable air-change rate, which is optimistic for a room with an active spore source. When in doubt, size up rather than matching the rating exactly to your square footage.
